"Object-cache TTL for READ endpoints. Set 0 to disable caching. Max 86400 "
"(24h)."
msgstr ""
"Object-cache TTL dla endpointów READ. Ustaw 0, aby wyłączyć buforowanie. "
"Maks. 86400 (24h)."

